/-! Lane owner:b-weighted-level-8, unit 2, segment 2d, piece 9: the level-`j` round
(`LevelJRound.round4JProgram`) followed, on the same stack `H4`, by a charged clear of the
previous output word `mw` in cell 55, a charged copy of the admitted level-`j` output word (cell
`oc secondOutput`) into cell 55 (temporary `.inr 56`), and a charged clear of the WHOLE bridge
region, charged through the growth conjunct of `level_dims_round_j` (the SAME bridge run).
`outSlots`, `copyOutP`, `outCell`, `srcOut`, `bridgeCells4`, `clearB4` are
`Level0DimsClean`'s; `blankBridge`, `nB` are owner-6's.

Exit bank EXACT, residue-free: `Function.update (ext4 (blankBridge (S2J …)) (DJc G c b yb j Mx))
outCell (actualPhysicalOutput … j …)`, where `DJc` holds the level-`(j+1)` rows/columns words in
fresh cells 0, 1 and is blank elsewhere. -/

